# Extension (MV3 ATTACH)

The extension is a **hand of the host**, not a Store product that works alone.

- Native messaging to the Tyto host only. Ignore any `{ type: "fromPage" }`.
- No `window.tyto`, no `postMessage` command channel from the document.
- Content scripts must not receive a runtime message type that executes CDP.
- `chrome.debugger` auto-attach on the operator-chosen tab. Debugger banner
  is accepted in ATTACH mode.
- Minimal `host_permissions`. No remotely hosted code (`script-src` http).
- Manifest V3: service worker, no persistent background page, no `eval`.

```js
// ❌ BAD
window.tyto = { click: (sel) => chrome.runtime.sendMessage({ cdp: sel }) };

// ✅ GOOD
chrome.runtime.onMessage.addListener(() => false); // page cannot drive CDP
```
